{title: In The Air}
{artist: L.A.B.}
{key: Am}

{comment: Chord Voicings}
{define: Dm7 base-lookup fret 10 fingers x 3 1 1 1 x}
{define: Am7 base-lookup fret 12 fingers x 1 3 1 2 x}
{define: G base-lookup fret 10 fingers x 1 3 3 3 x}
{define: F base-lookup fret 8 fingers x 1 3 3 3 x}
{define: Em base-lookup fret 7 fingers x 1 3 3 2 x}

{comment: Intro}
[Dm7]        [Am7] [G] (x4)

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Ooh, I feel it [Dm7]everywhere
It's [Am7]cold breathing in the [G]dark
Take me on, I'll [Dm7]lead you there
And [Am7]call me, will you be [G]far?
I don't wanna [Dm7]let you down
[Am7]Slowly, but not too [G]long
Ooh, I feel it [Dm7]in the air
You [Am7]know me, I'll keep you [G]on
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Interlude}
[Dm7]        [Am7] [G] (x4)

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
It's evident you [Dm7]want me now (Baby)
My [Am7]hearts beating on the [G]floor
I see it in the [Dm7]turn around
You [Am7]move me but I want [G]more
The memory is [Dm7]in the air (The memory is in the air)
The [Am7]music is all we [G]need
Ooh, I feel it, [Dm7]can't you see? (Can't you see? Ooh)
You [Am7]know me, I'll keep you [G]there
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Interlude}
[Dm7]        [Am7] [G] (x2)

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[F]Ooh, I get that feeling, [G]can I take you on a [Dm7]ride? (Take you on a ride)
[F]Knowing what I know, I can [Em]see it baby in your [Dm7]eyes?
'Cause it's [F]cool when we're full 'til the [G]morning from the early [Dm7]night, hey
[F]I can take a chance, [Em]loving your romance to[Dm7]night
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Girl, you know you [Dm7]turn me on (Know you turn me on)
I [Am7]like it, oh, can't you [G]see?
The way your moving [Dm7]on the floor (Moving on the floor)
The [Am7]fire, the way you [G]breathe
Can I take you [Dm7]home tonight? (You can take me home tonight)
We're [Am7]flying beneath the [G]sheets
Holding on to [Dm7]make me strong (Ooh)
To[Am7]night is the night I [G]need
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro}
[Dm7]        [Am7] [G] (x4)
